    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.35,
      "end_seconds": 75.11,
      "duration_seconds": 13.76,
      "text": "I was getting to to that! Oh, and not sleeping for days that's been about the same, three weeks the plan? That's been for about two weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.9,
      "end_seconds": 80.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to to day?"
