    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.1,
      "end_seconds": 99.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed no recent loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.61,
      "end_seconds": 104.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "did you get having taken tablets, drinking or hearing voices?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.22,
      "end_seconds": 118.63,
      "duration_seconds": 12.41,
      "text": "no, no having taken tablets, no drinking, no hearing voices i was feeling hopeless at one point, but that went away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.85,
      "end_seconds": 123.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.59,
      "end_seconds": 127.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "no, that side's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.99,
      "end_seconds": 132.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.96,
      "end_seconds": 138.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Sertraline. I take it 50 milligrams once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 139.22,
      "end_seconds": 147.55,
      "duration_seconds": 8.33,
      "text": "she is supposed to take it once a day, but I can't say she always does"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.39,
      "end_seconds": 154.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.72,
      "text": "I'm I'm on carbamazepine 200 milligrams twice a day for the seizures."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 157.99,
      "end_seconds": 166.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the carbamazepine was 400 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.23,
      "end_seconds": 170.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I see. Is the most recent prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.49,
      "end_seconds": 174.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "No, I left it at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.66,
      "end_seconds": 179.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.84,
      "end_seconds": 187.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "I have depression i'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. Epilepsy for about ten years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.63,
      "end_seconds": 199.03,
      "duration_seconds": 10.4,
      "text": "mm, okay. Right, so epilepsy is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.54,
      "end_seconds": 205.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "I had keyhole surgery on my gallbladder two years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.12,
      "end_seconds": 216.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.28,
      "end_seconds": 222.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.67,
      "end_seconds": 225.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.1,
      "end_seconds": 236.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Alright nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.45,
      "end_seconds": 263.47,
      "duration_seconds": 10.02,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 17 height 176 centimetres pulse 65 weight 70 kilos BMI works out to 22.6 blood pressure 113 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.93,
      "end_seconds": 269.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.82,
      "end_seconds": 272.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.48,
      "end_seconds": 290.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.61,
      "text": "You are calm but very flat, and you have thought through how you would do it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.81,
      "end_seconds": 291.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "sure thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.91,
      "end_seconds": 298.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "All finished thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.69,
      "end_seconds": 334.13,
      "duration_seconds": 17.44,
      "text": "Putting it all together I don't have a clear answer today: a high risk of suicide needing urgent assessment is possible and so is a severe depressive episode. An urgent mental health assessment is what I'd like next for suicidal thoughts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 334.96,
      "end_seconds": 337.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "The earliest is Friday 11:30 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.45,
      "end_seconds": 340.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Friday, that works for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.94,
      "end_seconds": 360.31,
      "duration_seconds": 17.37,
      "text": "I want you to stay with me while we arrange help, and your family will be called. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 361.48,
      "end_seconds": 363.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "That's fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.54,
      "end_seconds": 368.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "let's review you straight away have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.58,
      "end_seconds": 372.71,
